{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46131","headline":"春末寄周琏 · 贯休","name":"春末寄周琏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮角[含]风雨气曛，寂寥莓翠上衣巾。\n道情不向莺花薄，诗意自如天地春。\n梦入乱峰仍履雪，吟看芳草祗思人。\n手中孤桂月中在，来听泉声莫厌频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}